error[E0277]: `Receipt` cannot be written down, so it cannot be a procedure's `Output`
  --> tests/ui/output_without_byte_form.rs:17:19
   |
17 |     type Output = Receipt;
   |                   ^^^^^^^ this output has no byte form
   |
help: the trait `JournalValue` is not implemented for `Receipt`
  --> tests/ui/output_without_byte_form.rs:11:1
   |
11 | struct Receipt;
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = note: a procedure's output is the handoff to the next procedure, and a durable workflow journals that handoff at its commit barrier and re-seeds from it on crash-resume
   = note: add `#[derive(serde::Serialize, serde::Deserialize)]` to `Receipt`
note: required by a bound in `flezha_runner::Procedure::Output`
  --> src/procedure/mod.rs
   |
   |     type Output: Send + Sync + 'static + JournalValue;
   |                                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `Procedure::Output`
